Hostinger (optional integration)
--------------------------------

Hostinger is an optional integration and the schema is read at runtime.
No Hostinger SDK is installed. packages/deploy injects the client and
does not call the live API. The live method list is read from the
Hostinger MCP schema at integration time. This repo does not store a
token.

